      "meta_description": "<strong>&quot;Whenever I feel like exercise, I lie down until the feeling passes.&quot; - Robert M. Hutchins</strong>\n\t\n\tDay 13:  I'm feeling fairly lazy today.  I hate being lazy.  Actually, I think what I'm feeling is more like mental fatigue.  I was thinking about going to the gym, but I thought better of it.  Although I exert quite a bit of energy when I do go, I feel more energetic afterwards.  If I know that I'll have that pay-off, why aren't I going this evening?  Enough of my rambling.  Good night.  : )"
